#. Tag: refpurpose
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "A highly addictive &kde; card game."
msgstr "Un xogo de cartas aditivo do &kde;."

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kpat</command> <arg choice=\"opt\" rep=\"repeat\">Qt-option</arg> "
"<arg choice=\"opt\" rep=\"repeat\">KDE-option</arg> <group choice=\"opt"
"\"><option>--solvegame</option> <replaceable> file</replaceable></group> "
"<group choice=\"opt\"><option>--solve</option> <replaceable> num</"
"replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--start</option> "
"<replaceable> num</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--end</"
"option> <replaceable> num</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt"
"\"><option>--gametype</option> <replaceable> game</replaceable></group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kpat</command> <arg choice=\"opt\" rep=\"repeat\">opción do Qt</"
"arg> <arg choice=\"opt\" rep=\"repeat\">opción do KDE</arg> <group choice="
"\"opt\"><option>--solvegame</option> <replaceable> ficheiro</replaceable></"
"group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--solve</option> <replaceable> número</"
"replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--start</option> "
"<replaceable> número</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--"
"end</option> <replaceable> número</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt"
"\"><option>--gametype</option> <replaceable>xogo</replaceable></group>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRICIÓN"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kpatience; is a compendium of several well known patience card games, "
"ranging from the well known Klondike and Freecell, to lesser known games "
"such as Grandfather's Clock and Mod3. In all there are 12 variations for you "
"to while away time."
msgstr ""
"O &kpatience; é um conxunto de varios xogos coñecidos de paciencia de "
"cartas, desde os coñecidos Klondike e Freecell até outros como o Reloxo do "
"Avó e o Mod3. Ao todo están dispoñíbeis doce variacións para pasar o tempo."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPCIÓNS"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kpat.6.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This program follows the usual GNU command line syntax, with long options "
"starting with two dashes (`--'). A summary of the options supported by "
"<command>kpat</command> is included below."
msgstr ""
"Este programa segue a sintaxe de GNU para a liña de ordes, coas "
"opciónslongas a comezaren com dous guións (`--'). Embaixo inclúese unha "
"lista das opcións admitidas polo <command>kpat</command>."

